        <h2 class="card-title">Project Overview</h2>
      </div>
      <p class="card-text">
        The <strong>Binary Color Generator</strong> is an interactive web-based educational laboratory designed to illuminate the relationship between binary logic and digital color representation across computer systems.
      </p>
      <p class="card-text">
        By converting abstract strings of 0s and 1s into tangible RGB values and hex codes, this tool helps learners conceptualize how modern screens, GPUs, and web rendering engines interpret discrete memory states into 16.7 million vibrant colors.
      </p>
    </article>

    <!-- How It Works Workflow -->
    <article class="vite-about-card">
      <div class="card-header">
        <div class="vite-icon-box">
