      </div>
      <div class="vite-pipeline">
        <div class="pipeline-item">
          <span class="pipeline-badge">01</span>
          <div class="pipeline-content">
            <h3>Binary Stream Input</h3>
            <p>Three 8-bit strings are entered for Red, Green, and Blue (e.g. <code>11111111</code>) with real-time input sanitization.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="pipeline-item">
          <span class="pipeline-badge">02</span>
          <div class="pipeline-content">
            <h3>Binary to Decimal Conversion</h3>
            <p>Each byte is calculated via powers of two ($2^7 \dots 2^0$) to produce an integer value between 0 and 255.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="pipeline-item">
          <span class="pipeline-badge">03</span>
          <div class="pipeline-content">
            <h3>RGB Color Synthesis</h3>
            <p>The three discrete decimal intensities are combined in 3D color space to construct a composite RGB pixel.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="pipeline-item">
          <span class="pipeline-badge">04</span>
          <div class="pipeline-content">
            <h3>Visual &amp; Hex Display</h3>
            <p>The synthesized color is rendered alongside its CSS <code>#RRGGBB</code> hex string, nearest named color, and contrast guide.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </article>

